/*!
    \module RelatedIndexLinks
    \title Related Index Links Module
    \brief Synthetic consumer module for the related-node index round-trip fixture.
*/

/*!
    \page related-index-links-index.html
    \title Related Index Links
    \brief Landing page linking to every related non-member published by UpstreamRelated.

    This page exercises index round-trip resolution (QTBUG-151066): the
    consumer loads the producer's generated .index file in a fresh qdoc
    process, and every related non-member must be re-adopted correctly so
    that each link below resolves to the corresponding anchor on the
    producer's Widget documentation page, without warnings:

    \list
        \li \l Ns::Mode
        \li \l Ns::TimerId
        \li \l Ns::Handle
        \li \l Ns::makeHandle(const char*)
        \li \l Ns::makeHandle(int)
        \li \l GlobalId
    \endlist
*/
